extra('AC-002','Run with a controlled device-local today and a task without a date.','Create and edit tasks using yesterday, today and tomorrow, independently through the actual UI and the supported integration boundary.','All valid dates are accepted and remain the selected calendar dates. No minimum-today restriction prevents past-date entry.')
extra('AC-006','An existing task has a valid saved due date. Use controlled fixtures containing 2024-02-29, 2025-02-29 and 2024-02-30.','Save the valid leap-day value, then attempt impossible February dates through the supported data-entry and integration boundary.','The valid leap day saves. Impossible dates do not replace it. Validation communicates failure rather than claiming a save.')
extra('AC-007','Run equivalent date-entry fixtures in device timezones Pacific/Kiritimati and America/Los_Angeles, with the same selected calendar date.','Create, save, reload and edit the date, including a fixture near a daylight-saving transition.','The selected calendar date never shifts forward or backward because of timezone conversion; no time-of-day meaning is introduced.')
extra('AC-008','Use two unfinished task fixtures around a controlled local year boundary: 31 December and 1 January.','View the task list on 1 January device-local today.','31 December is overdue; 1 January is not. Existing creation order remains unchanged.')
extra('AC-009','A task is due on device-local today; the test clock can advance to the following local day.','View the list before midnight, advance the controlled local calendar day, then view the list again.','The date remains unchanged. It is not overdue on its due day and is overdue when viewed as unfinished the next day; no requirement for a background timer is invented.')
extra('AC-010','A task has a past due date and can be shown in the existing Active, Completed and All views.','Complete it, inspect the completed task date, reopen it and inspect its overdue state.','The date is retained across completion and reopening. Completed presentation has no overdue emphasis; reopening restores it without reordering.')
extra('AC-011','A task has an autosaved date change; separately exercise a task whose date was already cleared and saved.','Enter an unsaved valid date draft or an invalid draft and cancel before it is saved.','The latest saved changed date or cleared state is preserved. Cancel does not restore an older date or save the draft.')
extra('AC-012','Prepare dated and cleared tasks with active/completed states using an isolated database.','Stop the actual application process, restart with the same database, and inspect the saved task states through the UI and integration boundary.','Each date or absence of date, along with existing task identity/content/completion, survives restart. No personal database is used.')
